      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Standup Timer</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #1a1c23;\n      --card-bg: #282c37;\n      --border-dark: #121317;\n      --pixel-primary: #38bdf8;\n      --pixel-accent: #f43f5e;\n      --text-light: #f8fafc;\n      --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n      --pixel-highlight: #4ade80;\n      --btn-bg: #3b82f6;\n      --btn-active: #1d4ed8;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace, system-ui, sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      color: var(--text-light);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      background-image: \n        linear-gradient(45deg, #16181f 25%, transparent 25%),\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, #16181f 25%, transparent 25%),\n        linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #16181f 75%),\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #16181f 75%);\n      background-size: 20px 20px;\n      background-position: 0 0, 0 10px, 10px -10px, -10px 0px;\n    }\n\n    .timer-card {\n      background-color: var(--card-bg);\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 440px;\n      padding: 24px;\n      border: 4px solid var(--border-dark);\n      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px 0px #000000;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      text-align: center;\n      border-bottom: 4px dashed var(--border-dark);\n      padding-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--pixel-primary);\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;\n    }\n\n    .display-screen {\n      background-color: #0f172a;\n      border: 4px solid var(--border-dark);\n      box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 0px 0px #000000;\n      padding: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .timer-value {\n      font-size: 54px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--pixel-highlight);\n      letter-spacing: 4px;\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n\n    .status-text {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: var(--pixel-primary);\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .standup-over-banner {\n      font-size: 32px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--pixel-accent);\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      padding: 12px 0;\n    }\n\n    .participant-list {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .participant-item {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      background-color: #1e222d;\n      border: 2px solid var(--border-dark);\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .participant-item.active {\n      background-color: #1e3a47;\n      border-color: var(--pixel-primary);\n      color: #38bdf8;\n      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px 0px #000;\n    }\n\n    .participant-item.active .badge {\n      background-color: var(--pixel-highlight);\n      color: #000;\n    }\n\n    .participant-item.completed {\n      opacity: 0.5;\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n    }\n\n    .badge {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      padding: 3px 6px;\n      background-color: #334155;\n      color: var(--text-light);\n      border-radius: 0;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 14px 16px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background-color: var(--btn-bg);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      border: 3px solid #000000;\n      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px 0px #000000;\n      transition: transform 0.05s ease, box-shadow 0.05s ease;\n    }\n\n    .btn:hover {\n      background-color: #2563eb;\n    }\n\n    .btn:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px solid var(--pixel-primary);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .btn:active {\n      transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n      box-shadow: 1px 1px 0px 0px #000000;\n    }\n\n    .btn-secondary {\n      background-color: #475569;\n    }\n\n    .btn-secondary:hover {\n      background-color: #334155;\n    }\n\n    .sr-only {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 1px;\n      padding: 0;\n      margin: -1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"timer-card\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Pixel Standup Timer\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Standup Timer</h1>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"display-screen\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div id=\"activeView\">\n        <div class=\"timer-value\" id=\"timeDisplay\" aria-label=\"Remaining time\">1:30</div>\n        <div class=\"status-text\" id=\"currentSpeakerDisplay\">Speaker: Alice</div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"finishView\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"standup-over-banner\">Standup over</div>\n        <p class=\"status-text\">Great job team!</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-label=\"Speaker List\">\n      <ul class=\"participant-list\" id=\"participantList\"></ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"controls\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"nextBtn\" class=\"btn\">Next</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"restartBtn\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" hidden>Restart</button>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const DURATION = 90;\n    const NAMES = [\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\", \"Diana\"];\n\n    let currentIndex = 0;\n    let remainingSeconds = DURATION;\n    let timerInterval = null;\n\n    const timeDisplay = document.getElementById(\"timeDisplay\");\n    const currentSpeakerDisplay = document.getElementById(\"currentSpeakerDisplay\");\n    const activeView = document.getElementById(\"activeView\");\n    const finishView = document.getElementById(\"finishView\");\n    const participantList = document.getElementById(\"participantList\");\n    const nextBtn = document.getElementById(\"nextBtn\");\n    const restartBtn = document.getElementById(\"restartBtn\");\n\n    function formatTime(totalSeconds) {\n      const mins = Math.floor(totalSeconds / 60);\n      const secs = totalSeconds % 60;\n      return `${mins}:${secs < 10 ? '0' : ''}${secs}`;\n    }\n\n    function renderParticipants() {\n      participantList.innerHTML = \"\";\n      NAMES.forEach((name, index) => {\n        const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n        li.className = \"participant-item\";\n\n        const isOver = currentIndex >= NAMES.length;\n        const isActive = !isOver && index === currentIndex;\n        const isCompleted = isOver || index < currentIndex;\n\n        if (isActive) li.classList.add(\"active\");\n        if (isCompleted && !isActive) li.classList.add(\"completed\");\n\n        const nameSpan = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        nameSpan.textContent = name;\n\n        const badgeSpan = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        badgeSpan.className = \"badge\";\n        if (isActive) {\n          badgeSpan.textContent = \"Speaking\";\n        } else if (isCompleted) {\n          badgeSpan.textContent = \"Done\";\n        } else {\n          badgeSpan.textContent = \"Waiting\";\n        }\n\n        li.appendChild(nameSpan);\n        li.appendChild(badgeSpan);\n        participantList.appendChild(li);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function updateDisplay() {\n      timeDisplay.textContent = formatTime(remainingSeconds);\n      if (currentIndex < NAMES.length) {\n        currentSpeakerDisplay.textContent = `Speaker: ${NAMES[currentIndex]}`;\n      }\n    }\n\n    function startTimer() {\n      clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      timerInterval = setInterval(() => {\n        if (remainingSeconds > 0) {\n          remainingSeconds--;\n          updateDisplay();\n        } else {\n          nextPerson();\n        }\n      }, 1000);\n    }\n\n    function nextPerson() {\n      currentIndex++;\n      if (currentIndex >= NAMES.length) {\n        finishStandup();\n      } else {\n        remainingSeconds = DURATION;\n        updateDisplay();\n        renderParticipants();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function finishStandup() {\n      clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      timerInterval = null;\n      activeView.hidden = true;\n      finishView.hidden = false;\n      nextBtn.hidden = true;\n      restartBtn.hidden = false;\n      renderParticipants();\n    }\n\n    function resetStandup() {\n      clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      currentIndex = 0;\n      remainingSeconds = DURATION;\n      activeView.hidden = false;\n      finishView.hidden = true;\n      nextBtn.hidden = false;\n      restartBtn.hidden = true;\n      updateDisplay();\n      renderParticipants();\n      startTimer();\n    }\n\n    nextBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (currentIndex < NAMES.length) {\n        nextPerson();\n      }\n    });\n\n    restartBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      resetStandup();\n    });\n\n    // Keyboard accessibility for shortcuts\n    window.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n      if (e.code === \"Space\" && e.target === document.body) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if (!nextBtn.hidden) {\n          nextPerson();\n        } else if (!restartBtn.hidden) {\n          resetStandup();\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    // Initialize on page load\n    updateDisplay();\n    renderParticipants();\n    startTimer();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML file containing the markup, accessible ARIA attributes, embedded retro pixel styling, and standup timer logic."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Standup Timer\n\nA retro, offline-first pixel standup timer designed for agile teams.\n\n## Features\n\n- **4 Built-in Participants**: Alice, Bob, Charlie, and Diana.\n- **90 Seconds per Speaker**: Displayed in `m:ss` countdown format.\n- **Early Advance**: Click the `Next` button or press `Space` to move to the next person early.\n- **Speaker Highlighting**: The active speaker is clearly emphasized with high-contrast pixel badge indicators.\n- **Completion Screen**: Displays `'Standup over'` when the final speaker finishes.\n- **Completely Offline**: Zero external stylesheets, web fonts, or script dependencies.\n- **Accessibility**: ARIA live regions, keyboard focus outlines, and full screen-reader friendliness.\n\n## How to Run\n\n1. Open `index.html` directly in any modern web browser.\n2. No build tools, web servers, or internet connection required.",
      "description": "Project documentation explaining features, usage instructions, offline compatibility, and shortcuts."
    }
  ]
